 "title": "County Clerk &amp; Register of Deeds | Ontonagon County",
 "text": "County Clerk & Register of Deeds | Ontonagon County\nToggle navigation\nOntonagon County\nHome\nCounty Offices\n911 Director\nAirport\nBoard of Commissioners\nCircuit Court\nCounty Clerk & Register of Deeds\nCounty Park\nCounty Road Commission\nCounty Treasurer\nDistrict Court\nEmergency Services\nEqualization Department\nFriend of the Court\nEconomic Development Corporation\nMedical Examiner\nMine Inspector\nMSU Extension\nOn-Tran\nProbate Court\nProsecutor\nSheriff Department\nSoil Erosion\nTownships\nBergland Township\nBohemia Township\nCarp Lake Township\nGreenland Township\nHaight Township\nInterior Township\nMatchwood Township\nMcMillan Township\nOntonagon Township\nRockland Township\nStannard Township\nCounty Information\nLibraries\nSchool Districts\nVillage of Ontonagon\nElections\nVeterans Service Officer\nCalendar of Events\nCounty Clerk & Register of Deeds\nOFFICE PHONE: 906-884-4255 Located on the First Floor in the Courthouse\nYou can now order and purchase copies of Ontonagon County Vital Records through our website! Click the button below to order:\nCertified Birth Certificate (must have been born in Ontonagon County, and be a birth record for yourself or your child)\nCertified Copy of Marriage License (must have been an Ontonagon County resident at time of a Michigan marriage, or a resident of another state but married in Ontonagon County)\nCertified Death Record\n$10 fee for first copy of any vital record, $3 fee for each additional copy\n*Please note, a Vital Records Request Form must be completed and uploaded for the above purchases. An uploaded image of a Driver’s License is required to show proof of identity for purchase of Certified Birth Certificates.\nClick the links below:\nFee Schedule f or Register of Deeds\nList of Fees regarding Register of Deeds\nRegister of Deeds Public Record Search\nSearch and purchase recorded Register of Deeds documents\nVital Records Request\nComplete a Vital Records Request form to obtain copies of Certified Birth Certificates, Certified Copies of Marriage Licenses, and Certified Death Records. Form can be brought in person, mailed, or emailed. Contact our office with any questions at (906)884-4255.\nOntonagon County now offers Property Fraud Alerts!\nFor information on how to set up your property for fraud alerts, please click here: Property Fraud Alert Program\nThe form to sign up for the Property Fraud Alert Program is linked here: Property Fraud Alert Form\nHaley Rasmussen, County Clerk/Register of Deeds hrasmussen@ontonagoncounty.org\nJerri Corey, Chief Deputy (Circuit Court and Vital Records) jcorey@ontonagoncounty.org\nKimberly Gilmer, Deputy (Register of Deeds) kgilmer@ontonagoncounty.org\nAccounting Office: 906-884-4257\nMelissa Picotte, Accounting/Human Resources\nmpicotte@ontonagoncounty.org\nCopyright © 2016-2017 Ontonagon County. All Rights Reserved.\nSimple Business Theme\nPowered by WordPress",
